  "description": "SCIM 2.0 (RFC 7643 / RFC 7644) inbound provisioning companion for ToolUp.Platform: hosts /scim/v2/{Users,Groups} plus the ServiceProviderConfig / Schemas / ResourceTypes discovery documents, and maps an enterprise IdP's user and group lifecycle onto ITeamStore membership and IPermissionStore writes. Bearer-gated from ISecretStore with a constant-time compare; one token provisions exactly one team. Protocol-only — no vendor SDK, BCL and Giraffe only. Opt-in: a deployment that does not compose it mounts zero routes.",
